inbox dedupe by eventId (body-hash mismatch logged), resolve record by
sf_id then portalId then create, merge per in-scope field with one
history row each, sf_modstamp = GREATEST. Never writes the outbox.
applySnapshot implements the 412 re-read path (only fields != sf_value).
Doc says Postgres; the demo swaps in FileStore (whole-state atomic
temp+rename, serialised tx standing in for FOR UPDATE).
Not implemented here (documented in README): collision trigger /
verify_queue (§5 step 4f).

